cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the article given under
  preferred-citation.
type: software
title: "Deep Mechanistic Models"
abstract: >-
  Code to reproduce model training, hyperparameter tuning and figures of
  "Deep Mechanistic Models reveal pathway-extrinsic drivers of mammary MAPK
  signalling heterogeneity", including a Snakemake workflow that retrieves
  all input data and regenerates all figures.
